      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AILEEN'S SHINE (2) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only a neck (30.93) behind Forgery at this track. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Likely to be in the finish again. VICTA HOWARD (1) had won two in a row before finishing fourth (31.57) last time at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from seven starts. Cannot be left out. COMPTON AVA (5) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.3 lengths at Mt Gambier in a handy 29.75 beating High Cobber. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Expecting another bold showing. TERRIFIC DAVE (8) collected a minor prize last start and must be considered.",
